---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="글자 배치 | Seoyedoum" lang="ko">
  <main class="workspace">
    <aside class="controls">
      <header><h1>글자 배치</h1><p>글을 담고, 종이 위의 균형을 살펴보세요.</p></header>
      <label for="manuscript">배치할 글</label>
      <textarea id="manuscript" rows="7" placeholder="여기에 글을 입력하세요.">바람이 지나간 자리마다
고요한 마음을 놓아두고
오늘도 천천히 써 내려간다</textarea>
      <p class="hint">각 줄의 앞뒤 공백을 제거하고 한 줄로 이어 붙여, 오른쪽 열부터 열당 글자 수만큼 배치합니다.</p>
      <label for="seal">낙관</label>
      <input id="seal" type="text" placeholder="본문 뒤에 배치할 낙관을 입력하세요." />
      <label for="paper">용지</label>
      <select id="paper"><option value="half">반절지 · 35 × 135 cm</option><option value="full" selected>전지 · 70 × 135 cm</option><option value="national">국전지 · 70 × 205 cm</option></select>
      <div class="pair"><label>가로 (cm)<input id="paper-width" type="number" min="10" max="200" value="70" /></label><label>세로 (cm)<input id="paper-height" type="number" min="10" max="300" value="135" /></label></div>
      <div class="pair"><label>열 수<input id="columns" type="number" min="1" max="30" value="8" /></label><label>열당 글자 수<input id="rows" type="number" min="1" max="50" value="17" /></label></div>
      <label for="margin">용지 여백 <output id="margin-value">8%</output></label><input id="margin" type="range" min="3" max="20" value="8" />
      <label for="font-size">글자 크기 <output id="font-size-value">70%</output></label><input id="font-size" type="range" min="30" max="95" value="70" />
      <label for="seal-size">낙관 크기 <output id="seal-size-value">50%</output></label><input id="seal-size" type="range" min="20" max="95" value="50" />
      <label for="font">글꼴</label><select id="font"><option value="sj_lck">갈물이철경체</option><option value="sj_lmk">꽃뜰이미경체</option><option value="sj_kch">일중김충현체</option><option value="serif">명조체</option><option value="sans-serif">고딕체</option></select>
      <p class="hint">선택한 글꼴이 설치되어 있으면 적용하고, 없으면 명조체, 고딕체 순으로 표시합니다.</p>
      <div class="checks"><label><input id="grid" type="checkbox" checked /> 격자·번호 표시</label><label><input id="spaces" type="checkbox" /> 공백 한 칸 유지</label></div>
      <p class="hint">용지 크기는 직접 수정할 수 있습니다. 한 장을 넘는 글은 다음 장으로 이어집니다. 입력 내용은 서버에 저장하지 않습니다.</p>
    </aside>
    <section class="preview" aria-label="글자 배치 미리보기">
      <div class="toolbar"><span id="paper-info">전지 · 70 × 135 cm</span><div class="pagination"><button id="previous" type="button" aria-label="이전 장">←</button><output id="page-info" aria-live="polite">1 / 1장</output><button id="next" type="button" aria-label="다음 장">→</button></div></div>
      <div id="preview-viewport" class="canvas-area">
        <div id="paper-preview" role="img" aria-label="오른쪽에서 왼쪽으로 세로쓰기한 글자 배치"></div>
        <p id="render-status" role="status">미리보기를 준비하고 있습니다.</p>
        <div class="viewport-controls" role="group" aria-label="미리보기 확대 및 맞춤" title="휠: 이동 · Shift+휠: 가로 이동 · Cmd/Ctrl+휠: 확대·축소 · 드래그: 이동">
          <button id="fit-paper" type="button" aria-label="용지에 맞춤" title="용지에 맞춤">⤢</button>
          <button id="zoom-in" type="button" aria-label="확대" title="확대 (Cmd/Ctrl+휠)">＋</button>
          <button id="zoom-out" type="button" aria-label="축소" title="축소 (Cmd/Ctrl+휠)">−</button>
          <button id="download-png" type="button" aria-label="현재 장 PNG 다운로드" title="현재 장 PNG 다운로드">
            <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3v12m0 0 4-4m-4 4-4-4M4 17v3h16v-3" /></svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p id="layout-summary" class="summary" aria-live="polite"></p>
      <noscript>미리보기를 사용하려면 JavaScript를 활성화해 주세요.</noscript>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<script>
  import '../lib/layoutPreview';
</script>

<style>
  .workspace { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 320px minmax(0, 1fr); height: 100%; min-height: 0; }
  .controls { padding: 24px; border-right: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; overflow-y: auto; }
  h1 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  header p, .hint { color: var(--muted-foreground); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; }
  label { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; }
  textarea, select, input[type=number], input[type=text] { width: 100%; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--background); padding: 9px 10px; font-size: 13px; }
  textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 140px; line-height: 1.8; }
  input[type=range] { width: 100%; accent-color: var(--primary); }
  input[type=checkbox] { accent-color: var(--primary); }
  :is(input, select, textarea, button):focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--ring); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .pair { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; }
  .pair input { margin-top: 6px; }
  label output { float: right; color: var(--muted-foreground); }
  .checks { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .checks label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .preview { background: var(--muted); min-width: 0; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }
  .toolbar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: 12px; background: var(--card); }
  .pagination { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; white-space: nowrap; }
  button { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 5px; padding: 4px 10px; cursor: pointer; }
  button:disabled { opacity: .3; cursor: default; }
  .canvas-area { position: relative; flex: 1; min-height: 0; overflow: hidden; cursor: grab; touch-action: none; }
  .canvas-area:active { cursor: grabbing; }
  #paper-preview { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; transform-origin: top left; box-shadow: 0 3px 20px #00000012; }
  #paper-preview :global(canvas) { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
  #render-status { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted-foreground); text-align: center; }
  .viewport-controls { position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: 16px; transform: translateX(-50%); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; padding: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 16px; background: var(--card); box-shadow: 0 8px 20px #0002; cursor: default; z-index: 1; }
  .viewport-controls button { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 40px; height: 40px; padding: 0; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; background: transparent; color: var(--foreground); font-size: 22px; line-height: 1; }
  .viewport-controls svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; }
  .viewport-controls button:hover { background: var(--muted); }
  .viewport-controls button:active { background: var(--accent); }
  .summary { text-align: center; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted-foreground); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .workspace { height: auto; min-height: 100%; grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .controls { overflow: visible; border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); } .preview { height: 70dvh; min-height: 500px; } .toolbar { padding: 12px; } }
</style>
